// NDF-BEGIN: PTO-BSTART-GMOV-COLLECTIVE-001
// ndf: kind=contract level=L1 layer=block status=accepted
// GMOV MUST rendezvous and preflight all four peer-resolved Local sources, MAY
// use any nonzero PE_MASK solely to select destination writes, and MUST perform
// no global-memory or Shared-register effect.
// NDF-END: PTO-BSTART-GMOV-COLLECTIVE-001
